sequenceDiagram
    participant HF as HuggingFace API<br/>huggingface.co:443<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant GH as GitHub API<br/>api.github.com:443<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>registry.redhat.io:443<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Ext as model-extractor CLI<br/>(Build-Time)
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>data/*.yaml
    participant Img as Data Container Image<br/>UBI9-minimal
    participant Dash as RHOAI Dashboard

    Note over Ext: === Flow 1: Model Catalog Generation ===

    Ext->>HF: GET /api/collections (Bearer HF_TOKEN)
    HF-->>Ext: Model collection list
    Ext->>HF: GET /api/models/{id} (details, tags)
    HF-->>Ext: Model metadata (license, downloads, likes)
    Ext->>HF: GET /{model}/resolve/main/README.md
    HF-->>Ext: YAML frontmatter + README content

    Ext->>OCI: GET /v2/{repo}/manifests/{tag}
    OCI-->>Ext: Image manifest (multi-arch)
    Ext->>OCI: GET /v2/{repo}/blobs/{layer}
    OCI-->>Ext: Modelcard layer (tar/gzip)
    Note over Ext: Parse modelcard YAML,<br/>extract metadata via regex

    Note over Ext: Enrich: HF YAML > HF API ><br/>modelcard > regex > generated
    Note over Ext: Merge supplemental-catalog.yaml
    Note over Ext: Append vLLM recommended configs

    Ext->>FS: Write data/models-catalog.yaml
    Ext->>FS: Write data/validated-models-catalog.yaml
    Ext->>FS: Write data/enrichment.yaml (provenance)

    Note over Ext: === Flow 2: MCP Server Catalog ===

    Note over Ext: Read input/mcp_servers/*.yaml
    Ext->>OCI: GET /v2/{repo}/manifests/{tag}
    OCI-->>Ext: Architectures, timestamps
    Ext->>FS: Write data/*-mcp-servers-catalog.yaml

    Note over Ext: === Flow 3: Agent Catalog ===

    Ext->>GH: GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/branches/{branch}
    GH-->>Ext: Branch validation
    Ext->>GH: GET raw.githubusercontent.com/{path}/agent.yaml
    GH-->>Ext: Agent metadata
    Ext->>GH: GET raw.githubusercontent.com/{path}/README.md
    GH-->>Ext: Agent README
    Ext->>FS: Write data/redhat-agents-catalog.yaml

    Note over FS,Img: === Flow 4: Container Packaging (CI/CD) ===

    FS->>Img: COPY data/*.yaml /app/data/<br/>(Dockerfile.konflux)
    Note over Img: Image runs: sleep infinity<br/>(data mount only)

    Note over Img,Dash: === Flow 5: Runtime Consumption ===

    Dash->>Img: Volume mount /app/data
    Img-->>Dash: Catalog YAML files<br/>(models, MCP servers, agents)
